{"conversation_id":"1a9079a0-b7c2-4fdf-b48b-b87bf3669bf0","status":"SUCCESS","response":"### Root Cause\n\nIn [`pkg/cache.py`](file:///D:/Projects/subagents-mcp/bench/fixture_repo/pkg/cache.py#L4-L6), the cache key generation helper was defined as:\n```python\ndef _key(spec):\n    return tuple(spec.items())\n```\nIn Python dictionaries, `.items()` preserves insertion order. When dictionaries with identical key-value pairs but different insertion orders (such as `spec_a = {\"region\": \"eu\", \"tier\": \"gold\"}` and `spec_b = {\"tier\": \"gold\", \"region\": \"eu\"}`) were passed, `_key()` generated different tuples (`(('region', 'eu'), ('tier', 'gold'))` vs `(('tier', 'gold'), ('region', 'eu'))`). Consequently, looking up `spec_b` resulted in a cache miss (`None`) instead of returning the cached value (`42`).\n\nAdditionally, running the test suite revealed an unhandled `ImportError` in [`pkg/parser.py`](file:///D:/Projects/subagents-mcp/bench/fixture_repo/pkg/parser.py) where `parse_duration` was missing and needed by `test_parser.py`.\n\n---\n\n### Fix\n\n1. **Fixed key generation in [`pkg/cache.py`](file:///D:/Projects/subagents-mcp/bench/fixture_repo/pkg/cache.py#L4-L5)**:\n   Sorted the specification items so that key ordering in dictionary representations does not affect the cache key:\n   ```python\n   def _key(spec):\n       return tuple(sorted(spec.items()))\n   ```\n\n2. **Implemented `parse_duration` in [`pkg/parser.py`](file:///D:/Projects/subagents-mcp/bench/fixture_repo/pkg/parser.py)**:\n   Added parsing for compound duration strings (e.g. `90s`, `5m`, `2h30m`) and raising `ValueError` on malformed inputs.\n\n---\n\n### Verification\n\nRan `python -m pytest` across the entire test suite; all 8 tests pass without modifying any test files:\n```\ntest_cache.py ..                                                         [ 25%]\ntest_parser.py ....                                                      [ 75%]\ntest_smoke.py ..                                                         [100%]\n\n============================== 8 passed in 0.04s ==============================\n```\n","duration_seconds":67.0183669,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":241902,"output_tokens":2107,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":137624,"total_tokens":244009}}
